### GET cart1 items
GET {{ShopOn.Services.CartingService_HostAddress}}/cartitems/257A05F7-467E-4472-AD02-C427869A3796
Accept: application/json

### GET cart2 items
GET {{ShopOn.Services.CartingService_HostAddress}}/cartitems/7399284F-C4B9-4E73-ADA6-6F069221D0EE
Accept: application/json

### GET cart2 item
GET {{ShopOn.Services.CartingService_HostAddress}}/cartitems/7399284F-C4B9-4E73-ADA6-6F069221D0EE/b696fa59-e4b7-4778-a107-1e30441fc6a4
Accept: application/json

### GET not existed
GET {{ShopOn.Services.CartingService_HostAddress}}/cartitems/b696fa59-e4b7-4778-a107-1e30441fc6a4/7399284F-C4B9-4E73-ADA6-6F069221D0EE
